// tests/contract/routeCases.ts — one contract case per ROUTE_CONTRACTS entry
// Session 35 · Wave 4-3 · test-only · No enum, no namespace, no default export
//
// Each case has a happy path (input + the exact expected body, computed from the
// fixtures after the call) and an entry for every error status the contract
// lists. 401 (no identity), 403 (one role below the contract role) and 500
// (data layer throws) are generated by routes.contract.test.ts unless a case
// overrides them; every other status needs an explicit input or a `na` reason.
// coverage.contract.test.ts fails when a contract has no case or a listed
// status has neither.

